[{"id":"CN-HTTP-010","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["HTTP","CORS","预检"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/"}],"articleIndex":10,"articleCount":16,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>CORS 预检请求会携带什么，服务端需要证明什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>浏览器可能先发 OPTIONS，并携带 Origin、Access-Control-Request-Method、Access-Control-Request-Headers；服务端需返回匹配的 Allow-Origin、Allow-Methods、Allow-Headers 等许可。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>预检是浏览器在发送某些跨源实际请求前发出的 \u003ccode>OPTIONS\u003c/code> 请求，用来询问方法、请求头和凭据是否被允许。它通常携带：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight http\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"attribute\">Origin\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"punctuation\">: \u003c/span>https://app.example\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"attribute\">Access-Control-Request-Method\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"punctuation\">: \u003c/span>PUT\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"attribute\">Access-Control-Request-Headers\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"punctuation\">: \u003c/span>authorization\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>服务端需要用 \u003ccode>Access-Control-Allow-Origin\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>Access-Control-Allow-Methods\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>Access-Control-Allow-Headers\u003c/code> 等响应头证明这组来源、方法和请求头可用；带 Cookie 时还要匹配凭据规则。预检失败时实际请求可能根本没有发送；实际请求已有响应但脚本仍报错，则检查实际响应的允许来源和凭据规则。\u003ccode>curl\u003c/code> 成功不能代替浏览器预检验证。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a5-quote","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Linux","tags":["Shell","引号"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(五)Shell 语法与命令组合.md","articleTitle":"Linux(五)Shell 语法与命令组合","articlePath":"posts/72c1404c/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(五)Shell 语法与命令组合.md","articleTitle":"Linux(五)Shell 语法与命令组合","articlePath":"posts/72c1404c/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":5,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么 Shell 变量通常要放在双引号中？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>双引号保留变量展开后的整体参数边界，避免空格触发字段分割和路径名展开。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>未引用变量时，Shell 会继续做字段分割和 pathname expansion：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">name=\u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;two words&#x27;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">printf\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;&lt;%s&gt;\\n&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"variable\">$name\u003c/span>    \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 两个参数：&lt;two&gt;、&lt;words&gt;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">printf\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;&lt;%s&gt;\\n&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;\u003cspan class=\"variable\">$name\u003c/span>&quot;\u003c/span>  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 一个参数：&lt;two words&gt;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>省略引号只能在“确实要把一个值拆成多个参数”的位置出现，并且要先定义分隔协议。对用户输入使用数组或 \u003ccode>--\u003c/code> 传参，不要用 \u003ccode>eval\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>sh -c\u003c/code> 拼接未经处理的字符串。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-fixture-scope","type":"choice","priority":1,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["pytest","Fixture"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(八)测试框架设计.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(八)测试框架设计","articlePath":"posts/c92e7868/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(八)测试框架设计.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(八)测试框架设计","articlePath":"posts/c92e7868/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>可变的 BrowserContext、Page 和订单数据通常应使用什么作用域？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>C\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>Function 级资源把状态污染限制在单条用例。只有创建成本高且本身可安全共享的只读资源，才考虑更大作用域。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>作用域由共享风险决定：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"meta\">@pytest.fixture\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">order_context\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">browser\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    context = browser.new_context()\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">yield\u003c/span> context\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    context.close()\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>可变的 Context、Page 和订单数据通常按 function 创建；只有只读、可安全共享且清理边界明确的资源，才考虑更大作用域。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":["C"],"options":[{"key":"A","labelHtml":"\u003cp>Session\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"B","labelHtml":"\u003cp>全局单例\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"C","labelHtml":"\u003cp>Function\u003c/p>\n"}]},{"id":"pytest-rootdir-syspath","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Pytest","tags":["配置"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(八)配置与套件组织.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(八)配置与套件组织","articlePath":"posts/26397f68/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(八)配置与套件组织.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(八)配置与套件组织","articlePath":"posts/26397f68/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>rootdir 会自动修改 sys.path 吗？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>不会；rootdir 主要确定项目边界、配置、缓存和 Node ID，导入路径由布局、安装状态和导入模式决定。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>rootdir\u003c/code> 是 Pytest 的项目边界，不是 Python 的导入路径开关。它影响配置文件、\u003ccode>.pytest_cache\u003c/code> 和 Node ID 的相对起点；\u003ccode>sys.path\u003c/code> 仍由启动方式、安装状态和导入模式决定。\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">python -m pytest --trace-config --collect-only -q\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">python -c \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;import app; print(app.__file__)&#x27;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>采用 \u003ccode>src/\u003c/code> 布局时，应在当前环境安装项目（例如 editable install）或明确配置导入模式，再分别验证收集和实际 import。看到正确的 \u003ccode>rootdir\u003c/code> 不能推出业务包一定可导入。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"pytest-indirect","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Pytest","tags":["Fixture 参数化"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(六)参数化与用例建模.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(六)参数化与用例建模","articlePath":"posts/f6690364/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(六)参数化与用例建模.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(六)参数化与用例建模","articlePath":"posts/f6690364/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>indirect 参数化改变了哪一段数据流？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>参数值先进入 Fixture 的 request.param，再由 Fixture 创建测试资源，测试函数收到转换后的对象。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>indirect=True\u003c/code> 改变的是参数进入测试的路径：值先交给同名 Fixture 的 \u003ccode>request.param\u003c/code>，Fixture 再把它转换为可用资源。\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">8\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"meta\">@pytest.fixture\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">client\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">request\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">return\u003c/span> Client(base_url=request.param)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"meta\">@pytest.mark.parametrize(\u003cspan class=\"params\">\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;client&quot;\u003c/span>, [\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;https://staging.example&quot;\u003c/span>], indirect=\u003cspan class=\"literal\">True\u003c/span>\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">test_health\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">client\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">assert\u003c/span> client.health() == \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;ok&quot;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>这里只有 \u003ccode>client\u003c/code> 被间接参数化，所以只有它能可靠读取 \u003ccode>request.param\u003c/code>；普通 Fixture 不应无条件访问该属性。文件、数据库连接等需要 setup/teardown 的资源更适合走这条路径。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]